  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Steering Configs**\n\nOkay, I\'ve got a solid handle on the file scope. I\'m focusing on `/src/config/steering.ts`. The plan is to preserve the exact previous baseline in `BASELINE_STEERING_CONFIG`. After that, I\'m setting up `DIRECT_MOUSE_STEERING_CONFIG` with well-documented, conservative, independent parameters, ensuring clarity at every step.\n\n\n**Implementing Direct Steering**\n\nI\'m now implementing the \'direct-nonlinear\' steering mode. I\'ve defined parameters like `inputNormalizationRange`, `mouseSensitivity`, and `responseCurve` for nonlinear mouse input. Precision is addressed with `precisionLinearBlend`, and `softSaturationKnee` ensures smooth transitions. I\'ve also established independent yaw and pitch rate limits (`maxYawRate`, `maxPitchRate`, and rate balances) with optional `inputSmoothing`.\n\n\n**Refining Input Controls**\n\nI\'m now implementing smoothing, with a micro-filter for instant stops. I\'ve also set reference speeds for ship scaling. Aim boundaries remain separate. I\'m updating `STEERING_BOUNDS` with the new setting bounds, including aim-boundary dimensions. I\'m also creating a new pure, zero-allocation module, `/src/engine/MouseResponseCurve.ts`, with functions like `evaluateNonlinearGain`, `softSaturateSigned`, and `evaluateDirectMouseCurveScalar`.\n\n\n**Integrating New Functions**\n\nI\'ve been working on integrating new functions. I\'ve been focusing on `/src/engine/MouseResponseCurve.ts`, ensuring that `evaluateDirectMouseCurveScalar`, `softSaturateSigned`, and `linearBlend` function correctly. I\'m also implementing the `evaluateDirectMouseSteering` and `stepDirectAngularRate` functions. I\'m carefully managing the interaction with smoothing and ensuring zero-drift behavior is maintained with instant stops.\n\n\\n\\n\n\n**Updating Game Settings**\n\nI\'m now in the process of updating `/src/types/game.ts`. I\'m adding independent `maxYawRate`, `maxPitchRate`, and `inputSmoothing` fields to `GameSettings`. I\'m retaining `joystickRadius` and `deadzone` for baseline compatibility. I\'m also updating `/src/config/ships.ts`, including the new parameters in `DEFAULT_SETTINGS` and bumping `SETTINGS_STORAGE_KEY` to `\'starfall.settings.v7\'` with migration from v6.\n\n\n\n**Preserving Config Branches**\n\nI\'m making sure the `virtual-joystick-baseline` config is untouched for independent calibration reversion. I\'m keeping the aim boundary independent of the response curve, ensuring smooth reticle behavior in direct-nonlinear mode. Also, I plan to expose diagnostic state in `FlightController` for in-browser verification of per-frame values. Finally, I\'m updating `SteeringCurvePreview` in `SettingsPanel.tsx` and adding individual sensitivity controls.\n\n\n**Refining HUD Integration**\n\nI\'m now integrating with the Flight HUD. I\'ll hide the deadzone rectangle when direct-nonlinear steering is active. The aim boundary frame, reticle, boresight reticle, and tether will remain. I\'m verifying the `evaluateDirectMouseSteering` edge case related to varying frame times and mouse polling, particularly how `safeDt` impacts the velocity calculations. I\'ll clamp `velDt` to prevent issues from variable `dt` values.\n\n\n**Confirming Controller Integrity**\n\nI\'m verifying that core components remain untouched. It turns out `InputManager.ts`, `AimBoundary.ts`, `CameraController.ts`, and `CombatManager.ts` are all completely unaffected, ensuring zero regressions to input, aim boundary, camera, or combat. This means I can focus on new functionality without fear of breaking existing functionality. I\'m focusing on `/src/config/steering.ts` now.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "ojj_avD3BNnkqtsP9aHVgQo"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_14820246864593447895"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"/**\\n * Centralized steering configuration for STARFALL.\\n *\\n * Preserves two cleanly separated configurations:\\n * 1. `BASELINE_STEERING_CONFIG` \342\200\224 exact pre-calibration baseline preserved verbatim so this\\n *    calibration can be reverted independently by switching `steeringMode`.\\n * 2. `DIRECT_MOUSE_STEERING_CONFIG` \342\200\224 Precision + Fast Turning direct arcade mouse steering\\n *    calibration using a continuous nonlinear mouse response curve with independent parameters.\\n *\\n * Aim Boundary Geometry (`aimBoundaryWidth`, `aimBoundaryHeight`, `aimBoundaryCornerRadius`)\\n * remains strictly independent of the mouse response curve.\\n */\\n\\nexport type SteeringMode = \'direct-nonlinear\' | \'virtual-joystick-baseline\';\\n\\n/**\\n * Exact pre-calibration baseline preserved for independent rollback.\\n */\\nexport const BASELINE_STEERING_CONFIG = {\\n  aimBoundaryWidth: 0.3,\\n  aimBoundaryHeight: 0.35,\\n  aimBoundaryCornerRadius: 0.3,\\n  mouseSensitivity: 1.0,\\n  joystickRadius: 1.0,\\n  deadzone: 0.06,\\n  precisionSensitivity: 0.85,\\n  maxSteeringInput: 1.0,\\n  responseCurve: 1.35,\\n  yawRate: 1.0,\\n  pitchRate: 0.9,\\n  angularAcceleration: 18.0,\\n  angularDamping: 14.0,\\n  stoppingDampingBoost: 1.25,\\n  referenceViewportHeight: 720,\\n  maxSafeYawMultiplier: 2.0,\\n  maxSafePitchMultiplier: 2.0,\\n} as const;\\n\\n/**\\n * Calibrated Direct Arcade Mouse Steering profile (Precision + Fast Turning).\\n *\\n * Input Normalization Range:\\n *   `inputNormalizationRange = 1600 px/s` (26.67 px/frame at 60 FPS).\\n *   Instantaneous mouse speed `v = hypot(movementX, movementY) / dt` is normalized as:\\n *     `u = (v * mouseSensitivity) / inputNormalizationRange`\\n *\\n * Nonlinear Response Curve:\\n *   `g(u) = precisionLinearBlend * u + (1 - precisionLinearBlend) * u^responseCurve`\\n *   followed by independent yaw/pitch balance and C2-continuous soft saturation\\n *   (knee = `softSaturationKnee`) into `[-1, +1]`, then multiplied by independent\\n *   `maxYawRate` and `maxPitchRate` ceilings.\\n *\\n * Strictly Independent Parameters:\\n *   1. `mouseSensitivity`        \342\200\224 Base mouse sensitivity multiplier\\n *   2. `responseCurve`           \342\200\224 Nonlinear response curve exponent (`1.0` = linear)\\n *   3. `precisionLinearBlend`    \342\200\224 Subtle low-speed linear floor for micro-aim predictability\\n *   4. `maxYawRate`              \342\200\224 Independent maximum yaw angular speed ceiling (rad/s, ref hull)\\n *   5. `maxPitchRate`            \342\200\224 Independent maximum pitch angular speed ceiling (rad/s, ref hull)\\n *   6. `yawRate` / `pitchRate`   \342\200\224 Independent yaw/pitch sensitivity balance multipliers\\n *   7. `inputSmoothing`          \342\200\224 Optional minimal smoothing (`0` = instant, fast stop decay)\\n */\\nexport const DIRECT_MOUSE_STEERING_CONFIG = {\\n  /** Active steering pipeline mode (switch to \'virtual-joystick-baseline\' to revert independently) */\\n  steeringMode: \'direct-nonlinear\' as SteeringMode,\\n\\n  /** Documented input normalization reference speed in CSS px/s (26.67 px/frame at 60 FPS) */\\n  inputNormalizationRange: 1600,\\n\\n  /** Base mouse sensitivity multiplier applied to normalized mouse speed */\\n  mouseSensitivity: 1.0,\\n\\n  /** Nonlinear response curve exponent (1.0 = pure linear, >1.0 = fine low-speed + fast large turns) */\\n  responseCurve: 1.85,\\n\\n  /** Low-speed linear precision floor `a` in `g(u) = a*u + (1-a)*u^p` (prevents dead micro-aim) */\\n  precisionLinearBlend: 0.25,\\n\\n  /** C2-continuous soft saturation knee before reaching 1.0 ceiling (zero abrupt transitions) */\\n  softSaturationKnee: 0.85,\\n\\n  /** Independent maximum yaw angular rate for reference Interceptor hull (rad/s, ~200 deg/s) */\\n  maxYawRate: 3.5,\\n\\n  /** Independent maximum pitch angular rate for reference Interceptor hull (rad/s, ~172 deg/s) */\\n  maxPitchRate: 3.0,\\n\\n  /** Independent horizontal yaw sensitivity balance */\\n  yawRate: 1.0,\\n\\n  /** Independent vertical pitch sensitivity balance */\\n  pitchRate: 0.9,\\n\\n  /** Optional minimal input smoothing (0 = off/instant, 0.08 = 4ms micro-jitter filter with instant stop) */\\n  inputSmoothing: 0.08,\\n\\n  /** Maximum smoothing time constant (seconds) at inputSmoothing = 1.0 */\\n  smoothingMaxTauSec: 0.05,\\n\\n  /** Extra stop-speed multiplier when mouse input ceases so rotation halts cleanly with zero drift */\\n  stopDecayMultiplier: 2.5,\\n\\n  /** Reference Interceptor hull base rates used to preserve Striker / Destroyer class scaling */\\n  referenceInterceptorYawSpeed: 2.1,\\n  referenceInterceptorPitchSpeed: 1.95,\\n} as const;\\n\\nexport const STEERING_CONFIG = {\\n  // Independent aim boundary geometry (decoupled from mouse response curve)\\n  aimBoundaryWidth: BASELINE_STEERING_CONFIG.aimBoundaryWidth,\\n  aimBoundaryHeight: BASELINE_STEERING_CONFIG.aimBoundaryHeight,\\n  aimBoundaryCornerRadius: BASELINE_STEERING_CONFIG.aimBoundaryCornerRadius,\\n  joystickRadius: BASELINE_STEERING_CONFIG.joystickRadius,\\n\\n  // Active direct nonlinear steering calibration\\n  steeringMode: DIRECT_MOUSE_STEERING_CONFIG.steeringMode,\\n  inputNormalizationRange: DIRECT_MOUSE_STEERING_CONFIG.inputNormalizationRange,\\n  mouseSensitivity: DIRECT_MOUSE_STEERING_CONFIG.mouseSensitivity,\\n  responseCurve: DIRECT_MOUSE_STEERING_CONFIG.responseCurve,\\n  precisionLinearBlend: DIRECT_MOUSE_STEERING_CONFIG.precisionLinearBlend,\\n  softSaturationKnee: DIRECT_MOUSE_STEERING_CONFIG.softSaturationKnee,\\n  maxYawRate: DIRECT_MOUSE_STEERING_CONFIG.maxYawRate,\\n  maxPitchRate: DIRECT_MOUSE_STEERING_CONFIG.maxPitchRate,\\n  yawRate: DIRECT_MOUSE_STEERING_CONFIG.yawRate,\\n  pitchRate: DIRECT_MOUSE_STEERING_CONFIG.pitchRate,\\n  inputSmoothing: DIRECT_MOUSE_STEERING_CONFIG.inputSmoothing,\\n  smoothingMaxTauSec: DIRECT_MOUSE_STEERING_CONFIG.smoothingMaxTauSec,\\n  stopDecayMultiplier: DIRECT_MOUSE_STEERING_CONFIG.stopDecayMultiplier,\\n  referenceInterceptorYawSpeed: DIRECT_MOUSE_STEERING_CONFIG.referenceInterceptorYawSpeed,\\n  referenceInterceptorPitchSpeed: DIRECT_MOUSE_STEERING_CONFIG.referenceInterceptorPitchSpeed,\\n\\n  // Preserved baseline parameters (used only if steeringMode === \'virtual-joystick-baseline\')\\n  deadzone: BASELINE_STEERING_CONFIG.deadzone,\\n  precisionSensitivity: BASELINE_STEERING_CONFIG.precisionSensitivity,\\n  maxSteeringInput: BASELINE_STEERING_CONFIG.maxSteeringInput,\\n  angularAcceleration: BASELINE_STEERING_CONFIG.angularAcceleration,\\n  angularDamping: BASELINE_STEERING_CONFIG.angularDamping,\\n  stoppingDampingBoost: BASELINE_STEERING_CONFIG.stoppingDampingBoost,\\n  referenceViewportHeight: BASELINE_STEERING_CONFIG.referenceViewportHeight,\\n  maxSafeYawMultiplier: BASELINE_STEERING_CONFIG.maxSafeYawMultiplier,\\n  maxSafePitchMultiplier: BASELINE_STEERING_CONFIG.maxSafePitchMultiplier,\\n} as const;\\n\\nexport const STEERING_BOUNDS = {\\n  aimBoundaryWidth: { min: 0.16, max: 0.6 },\\n  aimBoundaryHeight: { min: 0.18, max: 0.65 },\\n  aimBoundaryCornerRadius: { min: 0.05, max: 0.9 },\\n  mouseSensitivity: { min: 0.3, max: 2.5 },\\n  joystickRadius: { min: 0.65, max: 1.5 },\\n  deadzone: { min: 0.0, max: 0.2 },\\n  precisionSensitivity: { min: 0.4, max: 1.2 },\\n  maxSteeringInput: { min: 0.5, max: 1.25 },\\n  responseCurve: { min: 1.0, max: 2.6 },\\n  maxYawRate: { min: 1.5, max: 5.5 },\\n  maxPitchRate: { min: 1.5, max: 5.0 },\\n  yawSensitivity: { min: 0.4, max: 1.8 },\\n  pitchSensitivity: { min: 0.4, max: 1.8 },\\n  inputSmoothing: { min: 0.0, max: 0.4 },\\n} as const;\\n\", \"Description\":\"Add calibrated direct nonlinear mouse steering config while preserving baseline steering config for independent rollback\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/config/steering.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating steering configuration\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update steering config\"}"
