      full: "=== 1. RESPONSE CURVE CONTINUITY & MONOTONICITY (500 samples u in [0, 2.0]) ==={ maxStepJump: 0.006107, maxSlopeDeltaPerStep: 0.04964, outAtU2: 1 }=== 2. SPEED SPECTRUM TABLE (60 FPS, default calibrated settings) ===dx= 0.5 px/f (  30 px/s) | u=0.019 | yaw=0.018 rad/s (1.0 deg/s) | 3.45 deg/100pxdx=   1 px/f (  60 px/s) | u=0.037 | yaw=0.039 rad/s (2.2 deg/s) | 3.71 deg/100pxdx=   2 px/f ( 120 px/s) | u=0.075 | yaw=0.087 rad/s (5.0 deg/s) | 4.17 deg/100pxdx=   5 px/f ( 300 px/s) | u=0.188 | yaw=0.283 rad/s (16.2 deg/s) | 5.40 deg/100pxdx=  10 px/f ( 600 px/s) | u=0.375 | yaw=0.756 rad/s (43.3 deg/s) | 7.22 deg/100pxdx=  16 px/f ( 960 px/s) | u=0.600 | yaw=1.545 rad/s (88.5 deg/s) | 9.22 deg/100pxdx=  25 px/f (1500 px/s) | u=0.938 | yaw=3.144 rad/s (180.1 deg/s) | 12.01 deg/100pxdx=  35 px/f (2100 px/s) | u=1.313 | yaw=3.500 rad/s (200.5 deg/s) | 9.55 deg/100pxdx=  50 px/f (3000 px/s) | u=1.875 | yaw=3.500 rad/s (200.5 deg/s) | 6.68 deg/100px=== 3. FRAME-RATE INDEPENDENCE (300 px/s & 1200 px/s across 30 / 60 / 120 FPS) ===speed=300 px/s over 0.5s: { \'30fps\': \'8.10 deg\', \'60fps\': \'8.09 deg\', \'120fps\': \'8.08 deg\' }speed=1200 px/s over 0.5s: { \'30fps\': \'62.96 deg\', \'60fps\': \'62.93 deg\', \'120fps\': \'62.82 deg\' }=== 4. RAPID DIRECTION REVERSAL (+25 px/f -> -25 px/f) ==={  beforeRev: -3.1437,  frame1AfterReversal: 3.1334,  frame2AfterReversal: 3.1435,  reversedOnFrame1: true}=== 5. IMMEDIATE STOP AFTER FULL TURN (ZERO DRIFT CHECK) ==={  turningYaw: -3.5,  turningPitch: -2.986,  stopF1: { yaw: 0, pitch: 0 },  stopF2: { yaw: 0, pitch: 0 },  driftOver20FramesDeg: 0,  reticleCentered: { x: 0, y: 0 }}=== 6. PARAMETER INDEPENDENCE & AIM BOUNDARY DECOUPLING ==={  aimBoundaryChangedPx: true,  yawUnchangedByAimBoundary: true,  pitchUnchangedByAimBoundary: true,  pitchUnchangedByMaxYaw: true,  yawChangedByMaxYaw: true,  yawUnchangedByMaxPitch: true,  pitchChangedByMaxPitch: true,  pitchUnchangedByYawBalance: true,  yawUnchangedByPitchBalance: true}=== 7. PRESERVED BASELINE ROLLBACK CHECK ==={  baselineModeActive: \'virtual-joystick-baseline\',  baselineSteerX: 0.0282,  baselineYawVel: -0.0123}ALL ENGINE VERIFICATION CHECKS PASSED!(node:6269) [THREE_CJS_DEPRECATED] DeprecationWarning: `require(\"three\")` is deprecated and will be removed.Replace `const THREE = require(\"three\")` with `import * as THREE from \"three\"`.(Use `node --trace-deprecation ...` to show where the warning was created)"
