  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Measured Results**\n\nI\'m incredibly impressed! The data is pristine. Across 500 samples, the curve maintains strict monotonicity with a negligible maximum step jump of only 0.006107, and it smoothly saturates at 1.00. I am thrilled at this degree of precision.\n\n\n**Calculating Angular Velocities**\n\nI\'ve been working on angular velocities. I\'ve calculated the speed spectrum at 60 FPS across various pixel-per-frame speeds, from micro-aim to large directional changes, and it\'s quite something. I\'ve also verified frame-rate independence. It\'s fascinating how the per-pixel steering strength increases with faster turns.\n\n\n"
    message_id: "ojn_aqHVArihqtsP1J3BsAI"
